title: Clone a repository
title-zh: 克隆仓库
---
# A recipes repository with two commits
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again.
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+hidden pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
> git add pancakes.md
> git commit -m "Add a pancake recipe"
# Alex has put it on the server
> git init --bare /srv/git/recipes.git
> git remote add origin /srv/git/recipes.git
> git push -u origin main
@as sam
$ git clone /srv/git/recipes.git
$ cd recipes
$ ls
$ git log --oneline
$ git remote -v
$ git branch -a
@graph cloned
